<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - First Union, Fleet, PNC cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - First Union, Fleet, PNC cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said analyst Elizabeth Summers downgraded First Union Corp, Fleet Financial Group Inc and PNC Bank Corp to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- cited recent stock price appreciation.</p>
<p>-- First Union closed up 3/4 to 69-1/8 on Friday. Fleet rose 5/8 to 46-1/8 and PNC gained one to 34-5/8.</p>
</text>
